eed to answer every question of course, just wanted to get a gut feel how people are using AI.<p>1) What AI subscriptions are you personally paying for? (Claude, ChatGPT/Codex, Cursor, etc)<p>- Which tiers?<p>- Have you purchased multiple subscriptions from the same provider (eg two Claude accounts)?<p>2) Are you using models outside (or instead) of those subscriptions? For example, pay-as-you-go APIs, OpenRouter, or locally hosted models.<p>- Which models and providers?<p>3) What coding harnesses and interfaces are you using? Are you sticking with the default CLIs or IDE integrations, or using alternatives like OpenCode, Pi, Aider, Muse Code, or custom-built harnesses?<p>- What made you switch harnesses (if you switched)?<p>4) Are you using any agent orchestration or swarm tools?<p>- For example, Munder Difflin, Gas Town, Ruflo, or something custom.<p>5) Are you using broader agent platforms like OpenClaw / Hermes Agent / Grok bot / Dots / Muse?<p>- If you are using them, what are your main use cases?<p>-----<p>I know my workflow has differed significantly from a year ago, and so it would be interesting to capture a snapshot today of what people are using and why."},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"Ask HN: What's your current AI agentic setup?"}},"_tags":["story","author_eggbrain","story_50366117","ask_hn","front_page"],"author":"eggbrain","children":[50367037,50367038,50367146,50367192,50367207,50367215,50367256,50367272,50367294,50367326,50367338,50367399,50367423,50367434,50367453,50367460,50367484,50367523,50367546,50367557,50367569,50367571,50367582,50367587,50367589,50367618,50367619,50367660,50367665,50367667,50367676,50367699,50367701,50367744,50367764,50367789,50367792,50367793,50367803,50367849,50367866,50367930,50367941,50367965,50367970,50367976,50368019,50368031,50368043,50368106,50368119,50368325,50368362,50368525,50368526,50368566,50368640,50369791,50370419,50370716,50370886,50371343,50371770,50372070,50373001,50373065,50373129