es Agent &#x2F; Grok bot &#x2F; Dots &#x2F; Muse?<p>- If you are using them, what are your main use cases?<p>-----<p>I know my workflow has differed significantly from a year ago, and so it would be interesting to capture a snapshot today of what people are using and why.","title":"Ask HN: What's your current AI agentic setup?","updated_at":"2026-11-05T14:55:39Z"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"dangelosaurus"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"A thousand fewer paths to root"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://openai.com/index/a-thousand-fewer-paths-to-root/"}},"_tags":["story","author_dangelosaurus","story_50372929","front_page"],"author":"dangelosaurus","children":[50372963,50373126,50373161,50373228,50373309,50373315,50373325,50373813,50374034,50374059,50374137,50374358,50374472,50374895,50375368,50375643,50375729,50375920,50375937,50376065,50376136,50376235,50376243,50376347,50376473,50376545,50376708,50376821,50376864,50376894,50376895,50376914,50377054,50377281,50377381,50377864,50378210,50378212,50378405,50378670,50379274,50379492],"created_at":"2026-11-04T23:33:14Z","created_at_i":1793835194,"num_comments":317,"objectID":"50372929","points":431,"story_id":50372929,"title":"A thousand fewer paths to root","updated_at":"2026-11-05T14:54:54Z","url":"https://openai.com/index/a-thousand-fewer-paths-to-root/"},{"_highlightResult":{"author":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"olexsmir"},"title":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"A new Go API for JSON"},"url":{"matchLevel":"none","matchedWords":[],"value":"https://go.dev/blog/jsonv2"}},"_tags":["story","author_olexsmir","story_50369106","front_page"],"author":"olexsmir","children":[50369779,50369853,50370463,50370500,50370505,50370631,50370735,50370812,50370984,50371745,50371862,50371995,50372103,50372538,50372973,50372978,50373172,50374195,50374365,50374457,50374628,50376155,50376220,50376415,503